      "created_at": "2018-08-30T20:07:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We tried to take him on last night, and got absolutely creamed.&nbsp; 5 man team of Lifeline, Ra, Dr. Medico, Legacy, and Benchmark, though I'm not sure how much that mattered ... the only way we could think of to possibly win would be for everybody to play characters with squidloads of healing and just outlast him, but that seems pretty dull and not-fun.</p><p>My wife was wondering if there was a rule we missed about how many times you can chain 'play the top card of the villain deck' cards?</p><p>Otherwise, how are you supposed to beat this guy?&nbsp; Do you have to smack him down and flip him to have a chance?</p>",
