      "created_at": "2018-08-30T20:30:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>But yeah, outlasting is a fairly workable strategy, and he&nbsp;<em>can</em> get samey, turn for turn, really quick. I find he's great in concept, but as an actual game session, only really worth it for telling Infinitor's story. (I.e., the heroes just beat Infinitor, okay! Let's go help him defeat his demons!)</p>",
